Sleek curves, a rev-hungry rotary and a taste for boost: Mazda's RX-7 Spirit R was built to make driving feel special. At Hina's Drift Club, that sports-car spirit comes with a little extra smoke.

Stronger turbocharged power and more weight than the Trueno make this the club's more mischievous companion. A complete drift setup and dedicated Hina's Drifters RX-7 tyres give you a familiar starting point, while the extra momentum rewards a well-timed catch and a thoughtful right foot. Settle into the seat, let the rotary sing and bring a little confidence. This one likes to keep you involved.
